	(text "D1 reverse-polarity blocking; F1 limits fault current; D2 clamps short input transients.\nNot a sustained-overvoltage disconnect. Use only the specified regulated adapter.\nSS14 drop reduces the coil/buck input slightly below the adapter voltage."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 152.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2901c07c-aa87-453f-b9af-5f752d7e4943")
	)
	(text "RECOM single-stage input EMI filter (nominal Class-A reference values).\nL1: Murata 1239AS-H-4R7M=P2; C2/C11: Samsung CL31A226KAHNNNE.\nKeep C11 directly at U1 VIN/GND; short loop. C1 retained upstream.\nMLCC DC bias, startup/ringing and system EMC remain unqualified.\nFilter feeds U1 only; relay/trigger +12V stays upstream."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 87.63 127 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "62b835a2-4532-4fbc-9d66-2ac86ed8c229")
	)
	(text "NO PCB MAINS. Do not update the old PCB from this schematic until layout work is authorised."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 254 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "650a4050-0dd4-4d5d-a2ab-7459ffa2f038")
	)
	(text "5V supply: 2A capacity. Budget 1.1A including both SPU03 modules.\nDetector preloads dissipate about 1.67W total at nominal voltage.\n12V adapter >=1A; input fuse T1A. Verify startup and temperatures.\nRipple/EMI and fuse coordination remain bench/layout checks."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 210.82 152.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "66e7fdbe-cf2c-41a7-b17d-62bb62e59a54")
	)
	(text "DC input only. G7L mains contacts and all 230V wiring are chassis-mounted off-board.\nPE remains continuous and is never switched. Supply GND is the controller ground only."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 33.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "77687c73-b637-46ad-9eb5-d7dba46f94bf")
	)
	(text "ISOLATED REGULATED 12V WALL ADAPTER: 12V +/-2%, >=1A"
